<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Capital Alliance issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Capital Alliance issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Black-controlled financial services group Capital Alliance said on Monday it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement. However, the group is widely seen as a frontrunner to acquire Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd's 47 percent stake in mining house JCI Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
